Revision history for Mojolicious-Plugin-Buffer

0.02	Mon Oct 26 2026
	Added an optional CHI-backed server-side response cache, used
	through the buffer_is_cached helper, so an action can skip its
	expensive work when a page is already cached.
	Cache keys can be varied by request headers or replaced with a
	custom string or coderef, and entries are invalidated when the
	application script changes.

0.01	Mon Oct 26 2026
	Initial version.
	HTML optimisation, gzip/brotli/zstd compression, ETag and
	Last-Modified generation, 304 handling, and per-request overrides
	for Mojolicious responses.
